{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2022-12-24 11:54:00', 'title': 'FIRSTENERGY AND PJM ASK CUSTOMERS TO CONSERVE ELECTRICITY', 'text': "GUIDANCE FROM GRID OPERATOR PREDICTS HIGH ELECTRIC DEMAND TODAY AMID EXTREME COLD AKRON, OHIO, DEC. 24, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DUE TO THE CONTINUING FRIGID WEATHER IMPACTING FIRSTENERGY'S SERVICE TERRITORY ALONG WITH MUCH OF THE COUNTRY, PJM INTERCONNECTION, THE ELECTRIC GRID OPERATOR FOR THE REGION, IS ASKING THAT CUSTOMERS TAKE STEPS TO CONSERVE ELECTRICITY THROUGH 10 A.M. ON SUNDAY, DECEMBER 25."}